henever  a government gets too big for its  britches probably not as much as as some  of us would like to see it being  restrained but that's the constant  tension that we have and thankfully  there is this check that is used at  least some of the time to keep the  majority from  rush roughshod over the minority we're  here for ask a libertarian keep those  questions coming and we'll see you again  real soon
 

